## Why This Is Asked

Tests for event-driven flows are common in production; beginners should grasp end-to-end testing, idempotency, and failure handling.

## Key Concepts

- End-to-end testing of queues and email sinks
- Idempotent processing of events
- Retries, backoff, and dead-letter queues
